  "notes": "USAGE:\nA basic cooking term frequently found in recipes. Part of the {下|した}～ (pre-/preliminary) pattern common in cooking: {下|した}{味|あじ} (preliminary seasoning), {下|した}{処理|しょり} (preliminary preparation), {下|した}ごしらえ (food preparation).\n\nSometimes written as {下茹|したゆ}で with the kanji for {茹|ゆ}でる.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {野菜|やさい}を{下|した}ゆでする: to parboil vegetables\n- {下|した}ゆでしておく: to parboil in advance\n- {下|した}ゆでした{麺|めん}: parboiled noodles",
